		<h1>About GridPermit</h1>
		<p>GridPermit is an independent educational platform built to help US homeowners navigate the changing economics of residential solar and battery storage systems across all 50 states.</p>
		<p>As utility companies across the country shift toward complex Time-of-Use (TOU) rate structures and reduced net metering export credits (such as California's NEM 3.0 rules and regional grid shifts in Texas, Florida, and the Northeast), evaluating solar investment requires accurate battery storage modeling.</p>
		<p>GridPermit provides fast, preliminary estimate models without requiring high-friction contact forms, empowering homeowners with transparent insights before connecting with certified local installation marketplaces.</p>
